# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Virtual environments and tool caches (README, Development)
.venv/
venv/
.ruff_cache/

# Output of the cluster suite: <experiment>/cluster/runs/
runs/

# Output of the P compiler (`p compile`) and checker (`p check`), wherever P is run, and of the
# .NET build it drives.
**/PGenerated/
**/PCheckerOutput/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# TLA+ tooling output, wherever TLC, the Toolbox, the VS Code extension or TLAPS is run: TLC's
# states directory (its default -metadir), the trace specifications and their binary traces it
# writes for a violation, Toolbox model folders, the proof manager's caches, and the backups the
# PlusCal translator leaves.
**/states/
*_TTrace_*.tla
*_TTrace_*.bin
*.toolbox/
**/.tlacache/
**/__tlacache__/
*.tla.old
